WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.922
Death was not an end but a crossing.

00:00:02.922 --> 00:00:11.038
When a life ended, the household entered mourning, priests were summoned, and the long ritual began.

00:00:11.038 --> 00:00:25.000
Offerings of bread, beer, and flowers were laid out, prayers were spoken for the journey west, and every gesture said the same thing: you are not gone, you are traveling.

